      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "I am providing you with a short video , which is going to be uploaded to my Instagram page. My page is about motivation, mindset, training , self-improvement, tips and advices for success, and inspirational or deep meaning quotes about different parts of life, and luxury lifestyle videos of expensive lifestyle.\nThe video that you need to analyze,  can be about any of the above listed topics or a few of them together. \nYour task is to analyze the provided video and determine in which of the categories mentioned above it resembles.\nAfter that you need to provide me with relevant hashtags that can be used for the video from the list of hashtags below , plus any hashtags of your suggestion (max 2). \nOutput ONLY the hashtags.\nMaximum of 13 hashtags per output.\n\nExample Hashtags for different video types:\n\n#quotes\n#hardtruths\n#masculine\n#aura\n#selfimprovement\n#motivation\n#grind\n#hustle\n#training\n#gettowork\n#advice\n#tips\n#inspiration\n#boxing\n#discipline\n#dedication\n#success\n#money\n#luxurylifestyle\n#milionaire\n#rich\n#luxury\n#truth\n#workout\n#god\n#godmode\n#lockin\n#prime",
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "models/gemini-2.5-pro",
          "cachedResultName": "models/gemini-2.5-pro"
        },
